        {
          "key": "B",
          "text": "还不想回酒店，跟着人流钻进夜市，找更吵的地方把耳朵继续填满",
          "effects": {
            "hss_intensity": 1.9,
            "hss_novelty": 1.7,
            "hsp_sensory": -1.7,
            "hsp_emotional": -1.6,
            "mot_hedonism": 1
          },
          "social_desirability": 1
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "先发定位问同行的人走到哪了，散场之后一个人走的那段路最难受",
          "effects": {
            "hsp_emotional": 1.7,
            "hss_novelty": -1.6,
            "big5_social": 1.1,
            "att_anxiety": 0.9
          },
          "social_desirability": 2
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "在出口回头站了半分钟，心里已经在查下一场在哪，眼睛还有点热",
          "effects": {
            "hsp_emotional": 1.8,
            "hss_novelty": 1.6,
            "big5_aesthetic": 1.1,
            "big5_rumination": 0.7
          },
          "social_desirability": 3
